</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/e87ea10af9a84d0e16a7a981c7883aa31c666f63" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -6.005ex; width:25.466ex; height:13.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \Gamma _{\text{w}}=g\,{\frac {\left(1+{\dfrac {H_{\text{v}}\,r}{R_{\text{sd}}\,T}}\right)}{\left(c_{\text{pd}}+{\dfrac {H_{\text{v}}^{2}\,r}{R_{\text{sw}}\,T^{2}}}\right)}}}"/></span></dd></dl>

<p id="mwAR0">where:</p>
